  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Roughly chop coriander.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-a9bdc300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook capsicum and corn, tossing, until lightly browned, 4-6 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.\n• TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are ‘popping’ out!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-60206010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook gnocchi, tossing occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes.\n• TIP: Add extra oil if the gnocchi is sticking to the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-6065ea20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• SPICY! This spice blend is hot. Add less if you're sensitive to heat. To the pan with gnocchi, add Mexican Fiesta spice blend and garlic. Cook, tossing, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Return cooked veggies to the pan, then add the water, brown sugar, butter and passata. Stir to combine, then simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-2cdb9630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer the saucy gnocchi to a baking dish.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until cheese is melted and golden, 5-10 minutes.\n• TIP: Grills cook fast, so keep an eye on the gnocchi!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-ad334c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy Mexican-spiced grilled gnocchi between bowls.\n• Drizzle with light sour cream (see ingredients).\n• Sprinkle with pickled jalapeños (if using), coriander and spring onion to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-54c13b50.jpg"
    }
  ]
